## Overview

- All 11 categories (30 components) share visibility gating, reduced-motion fallbacks and spring physics; continuous loops suspend while offscreen or inactive.
- Changing text values goes through `TxTextMorph` and vector icon transitions through `TxIconMorph`, avoiding duplicate diff or physics runtimes.
- Install from the Pro barrel or single-component subpaths; `TxDitherChart` also exposes the `@talex-touch/tuffex/charts` entry.

## Technologies

- Source adaptations keep Amicro's MIT attribution and source-file Apache-2.0 notices; Lucide glyph data keeps its ISC and applicable Feather-MIT notices, with no React or Lucide runtime dependency.

